@host = http://localhost:5127
@apiKey = <set your seeded API key here>

### List workflows
GET {{host}}/api/workflows
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List executions
GET {{host}}/api/executions
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Dead-letter queue counts
GET {{host}}/api/dead-letter/counts
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a workflow (draft)
POST {{host}}/api/workflows
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Sample workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "LogAudit",
      "name": "Start",
      "configuration": "{}"
    }
  ]
}

### Ingest an event (requires X-SignalForge-Timestamp + X-SignalForge-Signature headers
### computed over the raw body with the tenant webhook signing secret — see EventSignatureVerifier).
POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
X-SignalForge-Timestamp: {{$datetime 'yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ'}}
X-SignalForge-Signature: <hmac-sha256 of raw body>

{
  "type": "order.created",
  "data": { "id": 1 }
}